{"task_id": "HumanEval/46", "solution": "def fib4(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Computes the n-th element of the fib4 sequence iteratively.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0 or n == 1 or n == 3:\n        return 0\n    if n == 2:\n        return 2\n\n    # Initialize with fib4(0), fib4(1), fib4(2), fib4(3)\n    a, b, c, d = 0, 0, 2, 0\n\n    # Iterate from n=4 up to the desired n\n    for _ in range(4, n + 1):\n        next_fib = a + b + c + d\n        a, b, c, d = b, c, d, next_fib\n    \n    return d"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/47", "solution": "def median(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return median of elements in the list l.\"\"\"\n    # Sort the list to find the median.\n    sorted_l = sorted(l)\n    n = len(sorted_l)\n\n    if n % 2 == 1:\n        # Odd number of elements, return the middle element.\n        return sorted_l[n // 2]\n    else:\n        # Even number of elements, return the average of the two middle elements.\n        mid1 = sorted_l[n // 2 - 1]\n        mid2 = sorted_l[n // 2]\n        return (mid1 + mid2) / 2.0"}
